# Ulamog, the Defiler's "annihilator X, where X is the number of +1/+1 counters on it" (CR 702.86a) counts every counter,
# however many (CR 107.1), and the defending player sacrifices that many permanents. Turn 1: Black Lotuses pay for Bot1's
# Doubling Season. Turn 2: Bot2's pay for its own Doubling Season and Krenko, Mob Boss. Turn 3: Ulamog's cast trigger
# exiles the top half of Bot2's library with Emrakul, the Aeons Torn among it (mana value 15), so Ulamog enters with 15
# counters, doubled to 30. Krenko doubles into 3, 9, 27, 81, 243 and 729 Goblins on turns 4 to 14 (each X doubled
# again). Bristly Bill doubles Ulamog's counters on turns 13 and 15, each doubling doubled again: 90, then 270. Turn 15:
# Ulamog attacks, and Bot2, with 731 permanents, sacrifices 270 of them, not 255.

